WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
Standing medium punch connects on Ryu.

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.250
Manon cancels the standing medium punch into Drive Rush.

3
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:01.770
Rush crouching medium punch connects.

4
00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:02.350
Back medium kick starts the kick target sequence.

5
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:02.880
The medium-kick follow-up knocks Ryu downward.

6
00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.130
Light Dégagé hits after the target sequence.

7
00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:04.900
Manon recovers as Ryu rises from the low ender.
